#!/usr/bin/env qore
# -*- mode: qore; indent-tabs-mode: nil -*-
# the destructor of AbServers's data starts an HTTP/2 WebSocket server and an operation that creates an HTTP/2 SSE
# stream when the cleanup cancels it; the module cleanup reaches its deadline at once
# (QORE_MODULE_CLEANUP_TIMEOUT=0): the server's stream re-arms its heartbeat timer in work that the cleanup handed
# over after it, and the SSE stream in the work of an operation that the cleanup canceled, which are refused, and
# which the streams handle quietly (qore#7027)

%requires AbServers

printf("started\n");
flush();
